{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "13cd3852-d7c4-8c72-b705-4cb321caa606",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:08:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need a plow sent back out. The sidewalk near the school never got cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Which school are we talking about, and where's the spot exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one up my way. I'm at 343 Admiral Kalbfus Road. The sidewalk out front of the school, along that stretch. Nothing. Not touched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "343 Admiral Kalbfus, North End. Got it, I'm writing that down. And this is from the storm over the weekend? The snow that turned to rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Sunday into Monday. It's Tuesday now. Still a mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's all packed down and then it froze. Kids are walking in the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not great. That slush turns into ice overnight, especially after the rain. So the sidewalk is totally covered, not like a partial path?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally covered. No path. Maybe a few footprints."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:06:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it the sidewalk right along the school, or the stretch leading up to it from your street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Mostly the stretch leading up. The corner is the worst."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:06:27-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Corner, leading up to the school, nothing cleared. Okay. Let me put this in as a request for a crew to go back out. I can't tell you the exact hour they'll get there, they're working through a list after a storm like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today, though? Realistically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark it as a school route so it gets looked at sooner. I can't promise today, but I'll flag it. Do you want a call back if there's an update?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Just get it done. If you need me, 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven four, got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kathleen Gallagher."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gallagher, two L's, two G's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One L. Two L's in Kathleen, no. Wait. Gallagher is one L, two Gs... no, one G after the first. G-A-L-L-A-G-H-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "G-A-L-L-A-G-H-E-R. Perfect, thanks. That's in the system now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thank you. I hope you get a break soon. Sounds like a busy morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, I appreciate that. Phones have been going since seven. You have a good day, Ms. Gallagher."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
